#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:258
msgid ""
"Uses the Select2 dropdown already bundled with WooCommerce, so it works "
"alongside your theme without adding extra scripts. Turn this off if a theme "
"or another plugin visibly conflicts with it - the fields still work normally "
"as plain dropdowns either way. Only affects Classic Checkout; Block Checkout "
"already has its own searchable ward field."
msgstr ""
"Utilise le composant Select2 déjà fourni avec WooCommerce, sans script "
"supplémentaire, pour une bonne compatibilité avec votre thème. Désactivez "
"cette option si un thème ou une autre extension entre visiblement en conflit "
"avec elle - les champs continuent de fonctionner normalement comme des "
"listes déroulantes classiques. Ne concerne que le Classic Checkout ; le "
"Block Checkout dispose déjà de son propre champ de quartier consultable."

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:265
msgid "API Server"
msgstr "Serveur API"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:281
msgid ""
"Keep the default address filled in here to get administrative address "
"changes (province/ward renames, boundary updates) as soon as they're "
"published, without needing to update the plugin itself. Checkout still works "
"even if this is left blank or the server is temporarily unreachable - the "
"plugin automatically falls back to the data bundled with the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Nous recommandons de conserver le serveur API par défaut de l'extension pour "
"recevoir les dernières modifications des adresses administratives "
"vietnamiennes."

